<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="description" content="Responsive website audit and fixes by Pranav Arora.">
  <title>Pranav's Responsive Audit & Fixes</title>
  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
    }
    body {
      font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      padding: 1rem;
      background: #f4f6fb;
    }
    .container {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 960px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 5vw, 2.8rem);
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
    nav {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
    nav a {
      padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
      background: #1f3a93;
      color: #fff;
      border-radius: 6px;
      text-decoration: none;
      min-height: 44px;
    }
    .grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
      gap: 1rem;
    }
    .card {
      background: #fff;
      padding: 1rem;
      border-radius: 10px;
    }
    img {
      max-width: 100%;
      height: auto;
      display: block;
      border-radius: 8px;
    }
    .card h2 {
      margin-top: 0.75rem;
    }
    .table-wrap {
      overflow-x: auto;
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
      background: #fff;
    }
    table {
      border-collapse: collapse;
      min-width: 600px;
      width: 100%;
    }
    th,
    td {
      border: 1px solid #ddd;
      padding: 0.6rem;
      text-align: left;
    }
    th {
      background: #1f3a93;
      color: #fff;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <h1>Pranav's Responsive Audit – Fixed</h1>
    <nav>
      <a href="#home">Home</a>
      <a href="#services">Services</a>
      <a href="#pricing">Pricing</a>
      <a href="#blog">Blog</a>
      <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
    </nav>
    <div class="grid">
      <div class="card" id="home">
        <img src="https://picsum.photos/id/1011/800/500"
          alt="Boat on a quiet lake">
        <h2>Card One</h2>
        <p>Responsive images that fit inside their containers.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card" id="services">
        <img src="https://picsum.photos/id/1015/800/500"
          alt="Valley with a river">
        <h2>Card Two</h2>
        <p>Flexible layouts that adjust to different screen sizes.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card" id="blog">
        <img src="https://picsum.photos/id/1016/800/500"
          alt="Rocky canyon at dusk">
        <h2>Card Three</h2>
        <p>Cards automatically rearrange on smaller screens.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="table-wrap" id="pricing">
      <table>
        <tr>
          <th>Plan</th>
          <th>Storage</th>
          <th>Users</th>
          <th>Support</th>
          <th>Price</th>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Basic</td>
          <td>10 GB</td>
          <td>1</td>
          <td>Email</td>
          <td>₹0</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Pro</td>
          <td>100 GB</td>
          <td>5</td>
          <td>Chat</td>
          <td>₹499</td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </div>
    <h2 id="contact" style="margin-top: 1.5rem;">Responsive Design</h2>
    <p>This project demonstrates eight common responsive design fixes.</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
